{"version":1,"content":"<p>鄺潔楹（Judy）與丁子朗獲無綫頒發10年服務獎，Judy在台上被主持安德尊以「哈比人」稱呼她，她笑言已被這稱號糾纏10年，希望往後搣甩呢個標籤，回顧過去10年，她坦言：「感覺上唔覺得過咗10年，我最初係娛樂新聞台，係近6年先轉為拍劇。</p><p>」提</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.544384+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:45:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:14.356451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:14.356451+00:00","content_hash":"37c817ff40e6b777d502b460f46707974519a9d65a9442d9b1aa9cb2dd0a0b3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}